{"ISBN:9781668022399":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781668022399","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL57748312M/Abundant_Ever_After","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL57748312M/Abundant_Ever_After","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7942852A","name":"Cathy Heller"}],"dewey_decimal_class":["158.1"],"isbn_13":["9781668022399"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"number_of_pages":272,"publish_date":"2025","publishers":["Simon & Schuster"],"source_records":["bwb:9781668022399"],"title":"Abundant Ever After","weight":"0.207","subtitle":"Tools for Creating a Life of Prosperity and Ease","full_title":"Abundant Ever After Tools for Creating a Life of Prosperity and Ease","works":[{"key":"/works/OL31088345W"}],"key":"/books/OL57748312M","latest_revision":1,"revision":1,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2025-02-17T01:34:56.042200"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2025-02-17T01:34:56.042200"}}},"ISBN:9781668022405":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781668022405","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL42752111M/Abundant_Ever_After","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL42752111M/Abundant_Ever_After","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15259320-S.jpg","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7942852A","name":"Cathy Heller"}],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"pagination":"256","publish_date":"2023","publishers":["Simon & Schuster"],"source_records":["bwb:9781668022405"],"title":"Abundant Ever After","subtitle":"Building the Future You Can't Stop Dreaming About","full_title":"Abundant Ever After Building the Future You Can't Stop Dreaming About","works":[{"key":"/works/OL31088345W"}],"key":"/books/OL42752111M","covers":[15259320],"isbn_13":["9781668022405"],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"**Unlock the secret to creating an expansive life with this must-read guide from Cathy Heller, the renowned host of the mega-hit podcast *Abundant Ever After*, a leading voice in spiritual growth, manifestation, and personal empowerment.**\r\n\r\nRooted in profound spirituality, *Abundant Ever After* is a powerful guide for anyone ready to embrace abundance, unleash their most authentic self, and transform their life. With three years of immersive study in Jewish mysticism in Jerusalem and over twenty years of dedicated meditation practice, this book invites you to recognize and embrace the abundance that is often hidden in plain sight.\r\n\r\nLearn the art of surrender and the law of reception to manifest abundance and a life filled with joy, peace, and unlimited possibilities. Through the practical tools and exercises included in this guide, you can expand your capacity for abundance, dismantle limiting beliefs about money, align with your inherent worthiness, and redefine what it means to steward possibilities on behalf of the collective.\r\n\r\nUltimately, *Abundant Ever After* reminds us that we are here for so much more than material possessions. We seek synchronicity, mystical experiences, connection, and profound meaning. As you deepen your connection with your soul and the divine, you will uncover that love is the true essence of abundance. Embrace this journey and awaken to the limitless possibilities that await you."},"latest_revision":3,"revision":3,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-12-03T12:11:19.859043"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2026-09-28T15:26:38.900462"}}},"ISBN:9781668022382":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781668022382","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL42693376M/Abundant_Ever_After","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL42693376M/Abundant_Ever_After","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7942852A","name":"Cathy Heller"}],"isbn_13":["9781668022382"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"pagination":"256","publish_date":"2023","publishers":["Simon & Schuster"],"source_re